 images in Particular  Centroidal Pixels and We can Classify from the Centre Which Shape is Defined. We are Planing to  Use RESNET - Residual Neural Networks or Similar to be able to argue and analyze the better  Accuracy between all of the Networks. ","topics":[],"score":2196,"global_rank":185843},{"name":"dpalmasan/udacity-knowledge-mining","owner":"dpalmasan","html_url":"https://github.com/dpalmasan/udacity-knowledge-mining","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":"HTML","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2196,"global_rank":185846},{"name":"dpalmasan/udacity-nlp-azure","owner":"dpalmasan","html_url":"https://github.com/dpalmasan/udacity-nlp-azure","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":"CSS","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2196,"global_rank":185847},{"name":"ethanfaust/virtualization-docs","owner":"ethanfaust","html_url":"https://github.com/ethanfaust/virtualization-docs","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":null,"description":null,"topics":[],"score":2196,"global_rank":185849},{"name":"ethanfaust/hardware-recommendations","owner":"ethanfaust","html_url":"https://github.com/ethanfaust/hardware-recommendations","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":null,"description":null,"topics":[],"score":2196,"global_rank":185850},{"name":"ethanfaust/kvm-ubuntu-recipe","owner":"ethanfaust","html_url":"https://github.com/ethanfaust/kvm-ubuntu-recipe","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":"Shell","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2196,"global_rank":185851},{"name":"ethanfaust/kvm-fedora-recipe","owner":"ethanfaust","html_url":"https://github.com/ethanfaust/kvm-fedora-recipe","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":"Shell","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2196,"global_rank":185852},{"name":"ethanfaust/nginx-client-cert-auth-c2016","owner":"ethanfaust","html_url":"https://github.com/ethanfaust/nginx-client-cert-auth-c2016","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":null,"description":null,"topics":[],"score":2196,"global_rank":185853},{"nam